{
  "name": "01 Website form to CRM with AI reply",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Website form to CRM with AI reply\n\n**Setup**\n1. Open the **Config** node and fill every field (sender address, Google Sheet ID, Telegram chat ID, AI model).\n2. Replace the text in [square brackets] in the system prompt.\n3. Select your credentials on the nodes that show a warning: OpenAI, Google Sheets, SMTP, Telegram.\n4. In your Google Sheet create a tab named **Leads** and import `sheets/leads.csv` as the header row.\n5. Set the allowed origin on the webhook to your website, activate the workflow and post the form to the **production** URL.\n\nThe lead is always saved, even if the AI call fails. Set `auto_send_reply` to `false` in Config to only get the notification and review replies yourself. The Slack node is disabled by default.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "9ee6c639-2cda-47d7-956a-0c7340e6a2e5",
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "website-lead",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "https://your-website.example"
        }
      },
      "id": "74b87e72-3961-42e7-a148-168597fc86a7",
